{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Below is a detailed **Shopify Horizon AI Prompt** that will recreate this section as closely as possible while remaining fully editable in the Shopify theme editor.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify Horizon AI Prompt
    
    Create a **premium Contact Us section** with a modern dark aesthetic inspired by Apple and Linear.app. The section should closely match the provided design reference with identical spacing, typography, gradients, rounded corners, and layout.
    
    ## Section Layout
    
    * Full-width section.
    * Background color: **#070707**.
    * Maximum content width: **1320px**.
    * Horizontal padding: **32px**.
    * Vertical padding: **120px** top and bottom.
    * Two-column desktop layout.
    * Left column 45%.
    * Right column 55%.
    * Gap between columns: **80px**.
    * Vertically center both columns.
    * On tablet reduce spacing.
    * On mobile stack the columns with the form below the content.
    
    ---
    
    # Background Effects
    
    Add subtle blurred gradient glows.
    
    Top left:
    
    * Blue to purple radial glow.
    * Very soft blur.
    * Low opacity.
    
    Top right:
    
    * Orange radial glow.
    * Heavy blur.
    * Very soft.
    
    Bottom center:
    
    * Blue radial glow behind the form.
    * Low opacity.
    
    These should never overpower the content.
    
    ---
    
    # Left Content
    
    Top Badge
    
    Small pill badge.
    
    Text:
    
    Get in Touch
    
    Style
    
    * Height 34px
    * Horizontal padding 16px
    * Border radius 999px
    * Thin border rgba(255,255,255,.08)
    * Dark background
    * Blue text (#496BFF)
    * Font size 13px
    * Medium weight
    
    Spacing below badge:
    40px
    
    ---
    
    ## Heading
    
    Large bold heading:
    
    Let's Build
    
    Something Great
    
    The first line should be white.
    
    The second line should be orange (#FF7A1A).
    
    Typography
    
    * Font: Inter
    * Weight: 800
    * Size: 64px desktop
    * 52px tablet
    * 38px mobile
    * Line height: 1.05
    
    ---
    
    ## Description
    
    Whether you're launching your first store or migrating an enterprise catalog — we're ready. Tell us about your project.
    
    Typography
    
    * Width about 500px
    * Font size 18px
    * Line height 1.7
    * Color rgba(255,255,255,.65)
    
    Spacing
    
    40px below heading.
    
    ---
    
    # Contact Information
    
    Display vertically.
    
    Spacing between items:
    28px.
    
    Each item contains:
    
    ### Left Icon
    
    Circular icon container.
    
    * Size 44px
    * Blue gradient background
    * White icon
    * Border radius 50%
    * Soft shadow
    
    Icons
    
    Email
    
    Phone
    
    Location
    
    ---
    
    ### Right Text
    
    White text.
    
    Font size 16px.
    
    Weight 600.
    
    Items:
    
    [hello@rootsyntax.com](mailto:hello@rootsyntax.com)
    
    +1 (555) 000-0000
    
    Remote-first · Worldwide
    
    ---
    
    # Right Contact Card
    
    Create a floating premium card.
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Border radius:
    22px.
    
    Background:
    
    Very dark charcoal
    
    (#151515)
    
    Add a subtle purple/orange gradient overlay.
    
    Border:
    
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)
    
    Soft shadow.
    
    Padding:
    
    40px.
    
    ---
    
    # Form Layout
    
    Top row
    
    Two equal fields.
    
    Full Name
    
    Company
    
    Gap:
    
    20px.
    
    ---
    
    Second row
    
    Full width Email field.
    
    ---
    
    Third row
    
    Textarea
    
    Label:
    
    Tell us about your project
    
    Height:
    
    140px.
    
    ---
    
    Bottom
    
    Large gradient button.
    
    ---
    
    # Input Fields
    
    Rounded corners:
    
    16px.
    
    Height:
    
    54px.
    
    Background:
    
    #1E1E1E
    
    Border:
    
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)
    
    Placeholder:
    
    Gray.
    
    Label:
    
    White.
    
    Font:
    
    Inter.
    
    Focus state:
    
    Orange border.
    
    Blue shadow.
    
    Smooth transition.
    
    ---
    
    # Button
    
    Full width.
    
    Height:
    
    58px.
    
    Border radius:
    
    18px.
    
    Gradient:
    
    Left
    
    #3049FF
    
    to
    
    Right
    
    #FF7A1A
    
    White text.
    
    Bold.
    
    Include a paper plane icon after text.
    
    Button text
    
    Send Message
    
    Hover
    
    Slight lift.
    
    Gradient becomes brighter.
    
    Soft glow.
    
    Transition:
    
    250ms.
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    Fade-up animation on scroll.
    
    Card slides upward.
    
    Input focus animation.
    
    Button hover animation.
    
    Icons scale slightly on hover.
    
    ---
    
    # Responsive
    
    Desktop
    
    Two columns.
    
    Tablet
    
    Reduce heading size.
    
    Reduce spacing.
    
    Mobile
    
    Stack columns.
    
    Form below content.
    
    Button full width.
    
    Contact items remain left aligned.
    
    All fields full width.
    
    ---
    
    # Theme Editor Settings
    
    Allow merchants to edit:
    
    * Badge text
    * Heading
    * Highlight color
    * Description
    * Email
    * Phone
    * Address
    * Contact icons
    * Background colors
    * Card background
    * Form labels
    * Placeholder text
    * Button text
    * Button link/action
    * Gradient colors
    * Section spacing
    * Corner radius
    
    ---
    
    # Form Functionality
    
    Create a working Shopify contact form using the native **`contact`** form type.
    
    Include:
    
    * Full Name
    * Company
    * Email
    * Project Description
    
    Display success and error messages.
    
    Spam protection compatible with Shopify.
    
    ---
    
    # Overall Design Style
    
    The finished section should match the reference almost exactly with:
    
    * Premium dark UI
    * Large bold typography
    * Soft blue and orange glow effects
    * Pixel-perfect spacing
    * Large rounded corners
    * High-end SaaS aesthetic
    * Apple-inspired minimalism
    * Fully responsive
    * Optimized for the latest Shopify Horizon theme
    * Smooth animations and editable content via the Shopify theme editor.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(120px);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-contact-glow-tl-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    top: -200px;
    left: -200px;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.glow_color_1 }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  }

  .ai-contact-glow-tr-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    top: -150px;
    right: -150px;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.glow_color_2 }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  }

  .ai-contact-glow-bc-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    bottom: -100px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, {{ block.settings.glow_color_3 }} 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.glow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
  }

  .ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 45% 55%;
    gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.content_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: {{ block.settings.badge_height }}px;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.badge_padding }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.badge_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.badge_border_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.badge_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_highlight_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.info_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: {{ block.settings.icon_gradient }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(73, 107, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.info_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.info_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.card_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.card_overlay_1 }} 0%, {{ block.settings.card_overlay_2 }} 100%);
    opacity: {{ block.settings.card_overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: {{ block.settings.form_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.form_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.label_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.input_bg_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.input_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_radius }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.input_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.input_font_size }}px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    font-family: inherit;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: {{ block.settings.input_height }}px;
  }

  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: {{ block.settings.textarea_height }}px;
    padding: 16px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder,
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}::placeholder {
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_color }};
  }

  .ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus,
  .ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: {{ block.settings.input_focus_border }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px {{ block.settings.input_focus_shadow }};
  }

  .ai-contact-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.button_height }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_radius }}px;
    background: {{ block.settings.button_gradient }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(48, 73, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-contact-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(48, 73, 255, 0.4);
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .ai-contact-button-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    color: #10b981;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    color: #ef4444;
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_tablet }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal_tablet }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap_tablet }}px;
    }

    .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_tablet }}px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.padding_horizontal_mobile }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.column_gap_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-contact-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-contact-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-contact-glow-tl-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  <div class="ai-contact-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-contact-glow-tr-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  <div class="ai-contact-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-contact-glow-bc-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

  <div class="ai-contact-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-contact-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-contact-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.badge_text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading_line_1 != blank or block.settings.heading_line_2 != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-contact-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.heading_line_1 != blank %}
              {{ block.settings.heading_line_1 }}<br>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.heading_line_2 != blank %}
              <span class="ai-contact-heading-highlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_line_2 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-contact-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.description }}
          </p>
        {% endif %}

        <div class="ai-contact-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.email != blank %}
            <div class="ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                  <polyline points="3 7 12 13 21 7"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="ai-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.email }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.phone != blank %}
            <div class="ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="ai-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.phone }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.location != blank %}
            <div class="ai-contact-info-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="ai-contact-info-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.location }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% form 'contact' %}
          <div class="ai-contact-form-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-contact-form-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.label_name }}
                </label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="contact-name-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[name]"
                  class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_name }}"
                  required
                >
              </div>

              <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-company-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.label_company }}
                </label>
                <input
                  type="text"
                  id="contact-company-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  name="contact[company]"
                  class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_company }}"
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.label_email }}
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                id="contact-email-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[email]"
                class="ai-contact-input-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_email }}"
                required
                {% if form.errors %}
                  aria-invalid="true"
                  aria-describedby="contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                {% endif %}
                {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
                  aria-describedby="contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                {% endif %}
              >
            </div>

            <div class="ai-contact-field-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <label class="ai-contact-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}" for="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.label_message }}
              </label>
              <textarea
                id="contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                name="contact[body]"
                class="ai-contact-textarea-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                placeholder="{{ block.settings.placeholder_message }}"
                required
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="ai-contact-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
              <svg class="ai-contact-button-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <line x1="22" y1="2" x2="11" y2="13"></line>
                <polygon points="22 2 15 22 11 13 2 9 22 2"></polygon>
              </svg>
            </button>

            {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
              <div id="contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-contact-success-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.success_message }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}

            {% if form.errors %}
              <div id="contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}" class="ai-contact-message-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-contact-error-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ form.errors.messages.email }}
              </div>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endform %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class ContactSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.setupAnimations();
      }

      setupAnimations() {
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.style.opacity = '1';
              entry.target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
            }
          });
        }, { threshold: 0.1 });

        const leftContent = this.querySelector('.ai-contact-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        const card = this.querySelector('.ai-contact-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');

        if (leftContent) {
          leftContent.style.opacity = '0';
          leftContent.style.transform = 'translateY(30px)';
          leftContent.style.transition = 'opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease';
          observer.observe(leftContent);
        }

        if (card) {
          card.style.opacity = '0';
          card.style.transform = 'translateY(30px)';
          card.style.transition = 'opacity 0.6s ease 0.2s, transform 0.6s ease 0.2s';
          observer.observe(card);
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('contact-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', ContactSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

